恋人のささやき
Whispers of lovers,

277
00:36:19,556 --> 00:36:23,056
星くずの下
beneath the stardust,

278
00:36:23,056 --> 00:36:26,556
古のバラード
an ancient ballad.

279
00:36:26,556 --> 00:36:30,056
泉を満たして
Filling the spring,

280
00:36:30,056 --> 00:36:34,556
風は西へ
the wind goes to the west.

281
00:36:35,056 --> 00:36:41,556
優しい歌を君と歌いたい
I want to sing a gentle song with you.

282
00:36:42,056 --> 00:36:48,556
五月の月が今ここにある
The May moon is now right here.

283
00:36:48,856 --> 00:36:52,056
恋の歌が
As the love song...

284
00:36:52,056 --> 00:36:55,056
今夜響くから
...reverberates tonight,

285
00:36:55,256 --> 00:36:58,556
冷たい胸を
fill your cold chest...

286
00:36:58,856 --> 00:37:02,056
温もりで満たして
...with warmth.

287
00:37:02,256 --> 00:37:05,556
語ろう
Let us tell...

288
00:37:05,556 --> 00:37:11,556
愛の storia
...the storia of love.

289
00:37:44,256 --> 00:37:46,256
あれ？ 大丈夫？
Huh? Are you okay?

290
00:37:46,256 --> 00:37:48,256
大丈夫...ですか？
Are you... okay?

291
00:37:48,256 --> 00:37:51,556
あれ？ 動ける！ 動けるぞ！
Huh? We can move! We can move!

292
00:37:51,556 --> 00:37:54,056
やったー！ やったー！
Yay! We did it!

293
00:37:54,056 --> 00:37:56,556
動けるってなったね！
We can move now!

294
00:37:56,556 --> 00:37:58,856
いつものやつだ！
It's the usual trick!

295
00:37:58,856 --> 00:38:00,856
動ける、動ける！ よかった～！
We can move, we can move! Thank goodness!

296
00:38:00,856 --> 00:38:05,056
イナちゃんが助けてくれたやつ？
Is this what Ina-chan saved us with?

297
00:38:05,056 --> 00:38:10,056
なんとかぴょんしたら、動けるようになってよかった！
When I jumped around, you became able to move! I'm so glad!

298
00:38:10,056 --> 00:38:12,856
よかったー！ よかったー！
Thank goodness! Thank goodness!

299
00:38:13,056 --> 00:38:16,056
なんで石になってたんですか？
Why were you turned into stone?

300
00:38:16,056 --> 00:38:18,056
なんでだっけ？
Why was it again?

301
00:38:18,056 --> 00:38:20,556
なんか見たよね？
We saw something, right?

302
00:38:20,556 --> 00:38:23,056
なんかいた... なんかいたんだよね。
Something was there... There was something, right?

303
00:38:23,056 --> 00:38:25,556
翼が生えてたかな...
Did it have wings?

304
00:38:25,556 --> 00:38:28,056
なんか、龍っぽかったかな？
Like... was it dragon-like?

305
00:38:28,056 --> 00:38:30,056
龍？ ドラゴン？
A dragon?

306
00:38:30,056 --> 00:38:34,056
龍っぽかった気がするけど... なんか...
I feel like it was dragon-like, but... somehow...

307
00:38:34,056 --> 00:38:37,056
わっかんねえ！
I have no idea!

308
00:38:37,056 --> 00:38:41,556
ごめんごめん！ 覚えてないけど...
Sorry, sorry! We don't really remember, but...

309
00:38:42,056 --> 00:38:44,056
あ、そういえば！
Ah, speaking of which!

310
00:38:44,056 --> 00:38:45,056
イナちゃん！
Ina-chan!

311
00:38:45,056 --> 00:38:48,556
お誕生日じゃない？
Isn't it your birthday?

312
00:38:48,556 --> 00:38:51,556
そうです！ お誕生日です！
That's right! It's my birthday!

313
00:38:51,556 --> 00:38:55,056
おめでとー！
Happy birthday!

314
00:38:55,056 --> 00:38:59,056
いや、大好きな二人と一緒って嬉しー！
I'm so happy to be here with two people I love so much!

315
00:38:59,056 --> 00:39:04,056
照れるー！ 嬉しいー！
You're making us blush! We're so happy!

316
00:39:04,056 --> 00:39:08,556
イナちゃんと5期生は、デビューも近かったもんね。
Ina-chan and us 5th gen debuted around the same time, after all.

317
00:39:08,556 --> 00:39:13,556
そうですね、1ヶ月くらいだったから、もう同期...
Right, it was only about a month apart, so it almost feels like we're classmates...

318
00:39:13,556 --> 00:39:19,556
同期みたいな感じだから、嬉しい！
Since it feels like we're in the same gen, I'm so happy!

319
00:39:20,056 --> 00:39:24,056
そうですね。でも、ししろんと歌う機会があまりなくて...
That's right. But I didn't have many chances to sing with Shishiron...

320
00:39:24,056 --> 00:39:26,556
なかったから... 今回なんか...
Yeah, since we didn't... So this time...

321
00:39:26,556 --> 00:39:34,056
いつか、わため先輩とししろんと歌いたいなって...
I always wanted to sing with Watame-senpai and Shishiron someday...

322
00:39:34,056 --> 00:39:38,556
嬉しい！ めっちゃ嬉しい！
I'm so happy! Super happy!

323
00:39:38,556 --> 00:39:44,056
二人の歌声がめちゃくちゃ大、大、大好きなので、嬉しい！
I love both of your singing voices so, so much, so I'm really happy!

324
00:39:44,056 --> 00:39:47,556
ありがとう！ みんな大、大、大好きだよ！
Thank you! I love both of you so, so much!

325
00:39:47,556 --> 00:39:51,556
私の方が好きだから！
I love you more!

326
00:39:51,556 --> 00:39:54,056
いやいや、わための方が...
No no, Watame loves her more...

327
00:39:54,056 --> 00:39:59,056
やめて！ ケンカしないで！ どっちが好きなの？
Stop! Don't fight! Which one do you like more?

328
00:40:00,064 --> 00:40:01,864
好きなんだよなぁ
I really love this...

329
00:40:01,864 --> 00:40:03,564
助け... 助けて！
Help... Help me!

330
00:40:05,564 --> 00:40:08,564
あ、でもイナちゃん、なんか服が可愛くなってる！
Ah, but Ina-chan, your outfit looks so cute!

331
00:40:08,564 --> 00:40:11,064
そうですね、なんか... ドアがあって...
Yeah, like... there was a door...

332
00:40:11,064 --> 00:40:15,064
ドアをぴょんと、ぴょんとしたら、この衣装になりました！
I hopped right through it, and ended up in this outfit!

333
00:40:15,064 --> 00:40:18,064
かわいい！似合ってる！
So cute! It really suits you!

334
00:40:18,064 --> 00:40:20,564
よく見たらさ、Takodachi...
If you look closely... Takodachi...

335
00:40:20,564 --> 00:40:25,064
Takodachiがいっぱい居るんだよね、これ。
There are so many Takodachis on it!

336
00:40:25,064 --> 00:40:28,064
靴もTakodachi！
Even the shoes are Takodachis!

337
00:40:28,064 --> 00:40:30,564
そう、Takodachiなの可愛くない？
Right? Isn't it cute how they're Takodachis?

338
00:40:30,564 --> 00:40:32,564
おしゃれだね！ねー、いいなー！
That's so stylish! Yeah, I'm jealous~

339
00:40:33,064 --> 00:40:36,064
いや、でも... 嬉しい、この...
Ah, but... I'm so happy, this...

340
00:40:36,064 --> 00:40:44,064
う〜！あっという間！意味分かんない、嬉しい！
Wow~! It went by in a flash! It feels unreal, I'm so happy!

341
00:40:44,064 --> 00:40:46,064
こちらこそだよ！あ、わため...
Likewise! Ah, Watame...

342
00:40:46,064 --> 00:40:48,564
え、あなたちょっと時間があるんじゃないの？
Wait, don't you have somewhere you need to be soon?

343
00:40:48,564 --> 00:40:51,064
え、もう時間？やばい、やばい！
Wait, is it already time? Oh no, oh no!

344
00:40:51,064 --> 00:40:53,064
もう行かないと、行かないと！
I gotta go, I gotta go!

345
00:40:53,064 --> 00:40:56,064
Havernightの収録、あなたあるんじゃないの？
Don't you have a recording for Havernight?

346
00:40:56,064 --> 00:40:58,564
やばい！飛行機乗れない、飛行機乗っていかないと！
Oh no! I'll miss my flight, I have to go catch my plane!

347
00:40:58,564 --> 00:41:03,564
じゃあまたね！みんなありがとう！バイバイ！
See you later then! Thank you everyone! Bye-bye!

348
00:41:03,564 --> 00:41:08,064
なんか、なんか居るぞ？なんだあれ？
Wait, there's something over there? What's that?

349
00:41:08,064 --> 00:41:11,064
急げ、急げ！あ、急がないと！
Hurry, hurry! Ah, I gotta hurry too!

350
00:41:12,564 --> 00:41:22,564
That was so fun! I got to finally sing with Shiro and of course with Watame-senpai. I'm so, so happy, you know?

351
00:41:23,564 --> 00:41:28,564
Huh, did they say they saw something like a dragon? A dragon?

352
00:41:29,564 --> 00:41:40,064
Well, after all the singing and dancing, I'm kind of... kind of getting sleepy. So I'm just... gonna take a small nap, okay? I'm gonna take a small nap, so...

353
00:41:41,064 --> 00:41:46,564
Okay... Yeah, I'll just go... go...

354
00:42:13,064 --> 00:42:20,064
『とある竜の恋の歌』
[Title: Song of a Certain Dragon's Love]

355
00:42:20,564 --> 00:42:28,064
音の無き大地に 恋の歌 響けば
When a song of love echoes across the silent earth,

356
00:42:28,064 --> 00:42:39,564
狂い出す 歯車 止められぬ 宿命が はじけた
The gears turn wild, and an unstoppable destiny bursts forth.

357
00:42:40,064 --> 00:42:47,564
よみがえる 今 いにしえより
Reawakening now, from ancient times,

358
00:42:47,564 --> 00:42:58,564
継ぐ 記憶の 恋 目覚めた
the memories passed down... love has reawakened.

359
00:42:58,564 --> 00:43:07,564
絆を 求めて 炎は ほとばしる
Seeking a bond, the flames gush forth.

